  r1,"builtin-callable-reference-parses-in-loader-fields","",`main_source.loader` 为 `^<id>`,解析/校验 MUST 视其为合法 callable 引用(不以 “引用格式非法” 失败)
  r1,"builtin-callable-reference-parses-in-call-by-fields","",`fields.*.call_by` 或 `sources.*.normalize.call_by` 为 `^<id>(...)`,解析/校验 MUST 视其为合法 callable 引用(不以 “引用格式非法” 失败)
  r2,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r2,"unknown-builtin-id-fails-fast","",YAML 中出现 `^unknown/id`,"系统 MUST fail-fast"
  r3,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r3,"builtin-callable-works-without-adding-scalim-to-allowlist",allowlist 未包含 `scalim` 相关模块前缀,YAML loader/call_by 引用使用 `^<id>`,引用解析 MUST 成功(不因 allowlist 拒绝)
  r4,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r4,"builtin-callables-reference-string-is-rejected-if-not-allowl","调用方提供 `builtin_callables={\"x\": \"pkg.mod:fn\"}`",allowlist 未允许 `pkg.mod`,"系统 MUST fail-fast"
  r4,"builtin-callables-accepts-direct-callables-without-allowlist","调用方提供 `builtin_callables={\"x\": <callable>}`",YAML 引用 `^x`,系统 MUST 解析成功且不要求将 `scalim.*` 加入 allowlist
  r5,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r5,"workflow-book-sheet-rows-loader-id-is-available","","调用方在 YAML 中声明 `loader: ^workflow/book_sheet_rows`",解析与运行期 callable 解析 MUST 成功